<title>USA: Healthsouth Q1 dil oper shr $0.22 vs $0.17.</title>
<headline>Healthsouth Q1 dil oper shr $0.22 vs $0.17.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEALTHSOUTH CORPORATION</p>
<p>		(unaudited; in thousands, except per share date)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>								1997  1996(A)</p>
<p> Revenues					     $691,631 $612,149</p>
<p> Net income					     64,580   39,681</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common equivalent</p>
<p>  shares outstanding				 342,772  336,151</p>
