<p>Income per common and common equivalent</p>
<p>  share -- excluding non-recurring expenses     0.22     0.17</p>
<p>Income per common share excluding non-recurring</p>
<p>  expenses -- assuming full dilution		0.22     0.17</p>
<p>(A)  1996 amounts have been restated to include the results of Health Images, Inc. which was acquired in March 1997 in a transaction accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
